WEBVTT

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.920
We did it! We're here!

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.400
Better neighborhood, better schools.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.520
Come on, let's get this stuff upstairs.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.560
I had to leave behind everything I love.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.000
But now I'm insecure

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.560
and I care what people think.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.640
Mom, can we just go back home?

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:37.440
Honey, this is home now.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.120
Well, I have to go to work.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.120
I love you.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.480
Hi!

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.200
This is danger!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.000
No, wait, this isn't a home invasion.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Well, it is.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.800
I'm the Cat in the Hat.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.800
Let's turn those frowns upside down.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.880
We can do whatever you want.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:04.880
And then we just go back and undo it.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.480
Whoa.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.160
That watch can turn back time?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.500
Yeah, there's a bunch of boring warnings,

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.480
blah, blah, blah. Who cares?

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.080
We can go back to our life.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.560
Back to our home.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:15.560
This is awesome.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:16.560
Can I drive?

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.560
Well, it's incredibly dangerous.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.560
You betcha!

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.560
Wish we could turn back time.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.560
To the good old days.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.560
Our old neighborhood.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.560
Is it everything you remembered?

